    "zh": "从挂灰色外套的储物柜旁沿走廊前行，左侧可见两幅植物框画，右侧为储物柜/柜体；继续直行后到达右侧敞开的浴室门洞旁，可见灰色瓷砖、淋浴玻璃和地垫，但未观察到已完全通过该门洞或左转进入卧室。",
    "en": "Moved forward from beside the storage cabinet with the grey coat along the hallway, with two framed plant pictures on the left and the storage unit/cabinetry on the right; after continuing straight, reached the open bathroom doorway on the right, where grey tiles, shower glass, and a mat are visible, but it was not observed to have fully passed the doorway or turned left into the bedroom."
  },
  "reason": {
    "zh": "图像显示依次离开挂衣储物柜、沿带两幅植物画的走廊直行，并在B处到达右侧浴室门洞旁；这与任务中保持画在左、储物柜在右并直行经过浴室门口的要求一致，尚无左转进卧室等后续证据。",
    "en": "The frames show movement away from the coat storage cabinet, straight along a hallway with two plant pictures, and arrival beside the open bathroom doorway on the right at B; this is consistent with the task requirement to keep the pictures on the left and the storage unit on the right while continuing straight past the bathroom doorway, with no evidence yet of a left turn into the bedroom."
  },
  "instruction_evidence": [
    {
      "quote_en": "Walk straight into the hallway, keeping the wall with two framed plant pictures on your left and a storage unit on your right.",
