    },
    {
      "quote_en": "Continue straight past an open doorway leading to a bathroom on your right.",
      "quote_zh": "继续直行，经过右侧一个通向浴室的敞开门洞。"
    },
    {
      "quote_en": "Turn left through the next doorway to enter the bedroom.",
      "quote_zh": "从下一个门洞左转进入卧室。"
    }
  ],
  "visual_evidence": [
    {
      "frames": [89, 90],
      "description": {
        "zh": "A在挂灰色外套的木质储物柜旁；视角朝走廊延伸方向，随后开始沿走廊前行。",
        "en": "A is beside the wooden storage cabinet with a grey coat; the view is along the extending hallway, after which forward movement along the hallway begins."
      }
    },
    {
      "frames": [94, 98, 102],
