        "zh": "走廊左侧可见两幅植物框画，右侧为储物柜/柜体，前方为敞开通道；机器人持续向走廊深处直行。",
        "en": "Two framed plant pictures are visible on the left side of the hallway, storage cabinetry on the right, and an open passage ahead; the robot continues straight deeper into the hallway."
      }
    },
    {
      "frames": [106, 107],
      "description": {
        "zh": "B附近右侧出现敞开的浴室门洞，可见灰色瓷砖、玻璃淋浴和地垫；走廊继续向前，尚未看到左转进卧室或到达窗前停止点。",
        "en": "Near B, an open bathroom doorway appears on the right, with grey tiles, glass shower, and a mat visible; the hallway continues ahead, and no left turn into the bedroom or stop by the window is yet observed."
      }
    }
  ],
  "semantic_progress": {
    "zh": "截至B，已从挂灰色外套的储物柜旁沿走廊直行，途中左侧为两幅植物框画，右侧为储物柜/柜体；现已到达右侧敞开的浴室门洞旁，可见灰色瓷砖和淋浴玻璃。尚未确认完全通过该浴室门洞，未左转进入卧室，也未到达电视、梳妆台、床或窗前停止点。",
    "en": "As of B, the robot has moved straight along the hallway from beside the storage cabinet with the grey coat, passing two framed plant pictures on the left and storage cabinetry on the right; it has now reached beside the open bathroom doorway on the right, where grey tiles and glass shower panels are visible. It is not yet confirmed to have fully passed this bathroom doorway, turned left into the bedroom, or reached the TV, dresser, bed, or window stopping point."
  },
  "uncertainties": [
